  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: 5
  <Text>k__BackingField: Say, you wouldn't have five euros for the bus?
  <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: Officer Torrent
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Are you cosplaying?
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d605624f62f83e346b3b958050da111e, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Do you have some personal matters with someone?
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6666ea78157c0f845b59a69a21c676dd, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: No, sorry. I don't have a penny
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 52f0068dfdc8c094a945bac3c79b04ed, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Goodbye
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0c2b16b52947bf0409086f46f31787d9, type: 2}
